    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「ていうか、生徒会長を呼びだしてたなぁ。迷子になったのか、あいつ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 24,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「可哀想に！　心配だなぁ、きっと心細くて泣いているにちがいない……！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「とはいえまぁ、花丘さんに任せとけば安心だな。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 24,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「花丘さんは私たちの、君咲学院の『お母さん』だからな♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「『保護者』とは言い得て妙だ、うんうん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 24,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「しかし、迷子の呼びだしという手段があったか。使えるな、これは。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「うっかり見失ってしまった花音団員を呼びだせば、合流できるかも……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 24,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「いや待てよ。私たち花音団員を尾行してるんだし、呼びだしちゃ駄目か？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「まぁ、最後の手段にしておこう。それよりも……？」"
